('Kepler''s first law states that planets move in', 'Elliptical orbits with the Sun at one focus', 'Circular orbits', 'Parabolic orbits', 'Straight lines', 'option1', 'Kepler''s first law (law of orbits): planets move in ellipses with the Sun at one focus.', 'p_kepler_potential', 1, 'JEE Mains Prep', 'approved'),
